    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0116",
      "reading_order": 139,
      "section": "Fasteners used in this printer",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.99992,
        "t": 389.7871,
        "r": 542.5800000000002,
        "b": 342.1971
      },
      "content": "WARNING! Make sure that assemblies are replaced with the correct screw type. Using the incorrect screw (for example, substituting a long screw for the correct shorter screw) can cause damage to the printer or interfere with printer operation. Do not intermix screws that are removed from one assembly with the screws that are removed from another assembly.",
      "severity": "warning",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_135",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_135",
          "title": "Fasteners used in this printer"
        }
      ],
      "page": 17,
      "chunk_hint": "admonition",
      "semantic_role": "warning",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0117",
      "reading_order": 140,
      "section": "Fasteners used in this printer",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0,
        "t": 332.7871,
        "r": 549.4300000000003,
        "b": 297.1971
      },
      "content": "NOTE: To install a self-tapping screw, first turn it counterclockwise to align it with the existing thread pattern, and then carefully turn it clockwise to tighten. Do not overtighten. If a self-tapping screw hole becomes stripped, repair the screw hole or replace the affected assembly.",
      "severity": "note",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_135",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_135",
          "title": "Fasteners used in this printer"
        }
      ],
      "page": 17,
      "chunk_hint": "admonition",
      "semantic_role": "note",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0118",
      "reading_order": 141,
      "section": "Fasteners used in this printer",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0,
        "t": 287.7871,
        "r": 521.97005,
        "b": 264.1971
      },
      "content": "Always take note of the length, diameter, color, type, and location of each removed screw. Make sure that screws are installed in their original location during reinstallation.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_135",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
